        {
            "id": 8109890994212,
            "title": "Atlantic Ultraviolet UV Quartz Sleeve - Replacement Part",
            "body_html": "<h3>Atlantic Ultraviolet UV Quartz Sleeve - Replacement Part</h3><p>Genuine replacement quartz sleeve for Atlantic Ultraviolet water sterilization systems. This precision-engineered quartz glass sleeve protects the UV lamp while allowing maximum UV-C light transmission for effective water purification.</p><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>High-Purity Quartz</strong> - Superior UV-C light transmission for optimal sterilization</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Precision Fit</strong> - Designed specifically for Atlantic Ultraviolet systems</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Durable Construction</strong> - Resistant to thermal shock and chemical corrosion</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Critical Component</strong> - Protects UV lamp from water contact while maintaining effectiveness</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Replacement</strong> - Direct OEM replacement part</li>\n</ul><p><strong>Part Number:</strong> 15-1051A4<br><strong>SKU:</strong> 15-1051A4<br><strong>Application:</strong> Atlantic Ultraviolet water sterilization systems</p><p>Replace quartz sleeves regularly or when cracked, clouded, or damaged to maintain water purification effectiveness. Clean sleeves periodically to remove mineral deposits and ensure maximum UV transmission. Essential for safe, bacteria-free freshwater on your vessel.</p>",
